            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "TARALAMBERT21"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I added mushroom soup to this recipe, I didn't like the original recipes sweetness, so I added about 3 cans of mushroom soup in a can, then I gave it some spice with garlic powder and other seasonings. This is a good recipe, though I have modified it each time I made it.",
